# ZIP structural signatures (little-endian 32-bit magic numbers), one per libFuzzer dictionary
# token, as tokens Zip.cpp's checkSignature()/Signature enum actually look for. Single-line tokens
# only (a literal newline inside a token would split the .dict and abort libFuzzer's parser).
"PK\x03\x04"
"PK\x07\x08"
"PK\x01\x02"
"PK\x06\x06"
"PK\x06\x07"
"PK\x05\x06"
